# Dawnsire, Sunstar Dreadnought stationed with Gigantosaurus (power 10): ten charge counters give it "Whenever you attack, Dawnsire deals
# 100 damage to up to one target creature or planeswalker" but leave it a plain artifact (it is a creature only at 20+). On turn 5
# Bot1 attacks with Gigantosaurus; the trigger's targets are creatures and planeswalkers only (not a player, not Bot2's Mox Ruby),
# and 100 damage destroys Bot2's Raging Goblin before blockers, so Gigantosaurus's 10 damage reaches Bot2 (20 -> 10).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Gigantosaurus
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Dawnsire, Sunstar Dreadnought
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Raging Goblin
Island x20

